            "title": "Find the risky operation",
            "id": 152111,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Geçersiz miktar metni <code>ValueError</code> hatasına neden olabilir. Odaklanmış bir <code>try</code> bloğu, beklenen bu hataya karşı hangi işlemi korumalıdır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Importing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quantity = int(form[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"save_order(form, quantity)\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>form[\"quantity\"]</code>'yi <code>int()</code> ile dönüştürme</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">İçe aktarma mesajını görüntüleme</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tamamlanan siparişi kaydetme</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>form[\"quantity\"]</code>'yi <code>int()</code> ile dönüştürme.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kaydetme de <code>ValueError</code> oluşturabilir ancak miktar uyarısını yalnızca geçersiz miktar metni tetiklemelidir. Bu <code>try</code> içinde ne bulunur?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Importing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quantity = int(form[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"save_order(form, quantity)\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Yalnızca form[\"quantity\"] değerini int() ile dönüştürmek.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dönüştürme ve save_order() birlikte.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca save_order().</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Üç satır da; böylece her ValueError miktar uyarısı oluşturur.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Yalnızca form[\"quantity\"] değerini int() ile dönüştürmek.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Keep the try block narrow",
            "id": 152112,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Miktar dönüşümünün etrafındaki odaklanılmış bloğu tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"process\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(form)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Importing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    quantity = int(form[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quantity\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>try</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Catch the expected error",
            "id": 152113,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yalnızca geçersiz sayısal metinden beklenen hatayı yakala.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"seat_parser.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_seats\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(value)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"KeyError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ValueError</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yalnızca geçersiz sayısal metni yakala ve koltuk sayısı uydurmadan başarısızlık değeri döndür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"seat_parser.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_seats\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(value)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"KeyError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Exception\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>ValueError</code>, ardından <code>None</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Choose the recovery point",
            "id": 152114,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>parse_port()</code> metni dönüştürür. <code>start_server()</code> başlatma işlemini iptal edebilir ve yararlı bir mesaj gösterebilir. <code>ValueError</code> nerede yakalanmalıdır?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>start_server()</code> içinde, <code>parse_port()</code> çağrısının çevresinde</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>parse_port()</code> içinde, <code>int()</code> çağrılmadan önce</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Yerleşik <code>int()</code> fonksiyonunun içinde</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>start_server()</code> içinde, <code>parse_port()</code> çağrısının çevresinde.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İki çağıran <code>parse_port()</code> kullanır ancak başlatmayı yalnızca <code>start_server()</code> iptal edebilir. Başlatma kurtarması nerede olmalıdır?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">ValueError'ı start_server() içinde, parse_port() çağrısının çevresinde yakala.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">parse_port() içinde yakala ve her çağırana daima 0 döndür.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">İki fonksiyonda da yakala; parse_port() önce 0 döndürsün.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">parse_port() çağrısı tamamlandıktan sonra yakala.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">ValueError'ı start_server() içinde, parse_port() çağrısının çevresinde yakala.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Keep other work visible",
            "id": 152115,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hata işlemeyi daha hedefli hale getirmek için kodun hangi bölümleri <code>try</code> bloğunun dışına taşınmalı?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  quantity = int(order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  total = quantity * order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;price&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  save_order(total)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Toplam hesaplama ve <code>save_order()</code> çağrısı</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Miktar dönüşümü</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Fonksiyondaki her satır</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Toplam hesaplama ve <code>save_order()</code> çağrısı.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Miktar geçerli ancak <code>save_order()</code>, <code>ValueError</code> oluşturur. Uyarıyı yalnızca miktar hataları yazdırmalıdır. Ne dışarı taşınmalıdır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  quantity = int(order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  total = quantity * order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;price&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  save_order(total)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Toplam hesaplama ve save_order() çağrısı.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca miktar dönüştürme.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca toplam hesaplama; save_order() korunsun.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Hiçbir şey; eşleşen exception türleri daima aynı yanıtı gerektirir.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Toplam hesaplama ve save_order() çağrısı.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Handle a missing key",
            "id": 152116,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eksik miktar anahtarı için ilk özel işleyiciyi tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_quantity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(order)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>KeyError</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eksik miktar anahtarı ve geçersiz tam sayı metni için ayrı mesajlar döndür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_quantity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(order)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"149\" endIndex=\"167\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Missing quantity&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>KeyError</code>, ardından <code>\"Invalid quantity\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
