          {
            "title": "Protect a port setting",
            "id": 152117,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>settings[\"port\"]</code><code>\"abc\"</code> gibi bir değer içerirse ne olur?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  port = int(settings[\" /><text value=\"&quot;port&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid port&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Fonksiyon <code>\"Invalid port\"</code> değerini döndürür</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fonksiyon <code>\"abc\"</code> döndürür</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Fonksiyon <code>0</code> döndürür</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Fonksiyon <code>\"Invalid port\"</code> değerini döndürür.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu fonksiyonun içinde <code>settings</code>, <code>\"port\"</code> anahtarına sahip değilse ne olur?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  port = int(settings[\" /><text value=\"&quot;port&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid port&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bu handler KeyError'ı yakalamadığı için hata fonksiyondan çıkar.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fonksiyon \"Invalid port\" döndürür.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Fonksiyon 0 döndürür.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Fonksiyon hatayı yakaladıktan sonra None döndürür.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bu handler KeyError'ı yakalamadığı için hata fonksiyondan çıkar.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
